      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِمْعَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A mode,</i> or <i>manner, of hearing, hearkening,</i> or <i>listening.</i> (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمِعْتُهُ سِمْعَةً</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَسَنَةً</span> [<i>I heard it with a good manner of hearing</i>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِمْعَةُ أُذُنِى فُلَانًا يَقُولُ ذٰلِكَ</span>: see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمْعٌ</span>.

